  "title": "Beverly Center | LA's Premier Food, Fashion, and Shopping Destination",
  "description": "Beverly Center is an iconic eight-story shopping destination in the heart of Los Angeles, featuring luxury retailers, contemporary fashion brands, and a renowned rooftop dining terrace. Located at the intersection of Beverly Boulevard and La Cienega, this architectural landmark offers a premier shopping experience with stunning panoramic views of the Hollywood Hills and downtown LA.",
  "squareFootage": 860000,
  "numberOfStores": 100,
  "demographics": "Beverly Center attracts an affluent, fashion-forward demographic with visitors predominantly aged 25-54, skewing toward higher household incomes ($75,000+) and urban professionals from West Hollywood, Beverly Hills, and surrounding upscale LA neighborhoods. The trade area draws both local residents seeking luxury and contemporary fashion as well as international tourists exploring Los Angeles' premier shopping destinations. Shoppers here prioritize brand-name retailers, designer fashion, and upscale dining experiences, with strong representation from LGBTQ+ community members and entertainment industry professionals who value the center's accessible West Hollywood location and curated tenant mix.",
  "centerType": "RegionalMall",
